================================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================================

The Java sources in this repository are Apache-2.0. The published container
images additionally bundle third-party software, and that software keeps its own
licence. This file lists what each image contains so downstream consumers can
satisfy the attribution obligations that come with it.

Licences were confirmed from package metadata rather than assumed. Versions are
the build defaults; several are overridable at build time (see "Version pinning"
in README.md), so an image built with an override may differ from this list.

